      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MY LITTLE FLOSS (1) produced a moderate performance last time when seventh at Healesville over 300m behind Royce Van Winkle (17.30) in a T3 RSTW. Was a winner prior to that. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Key runner on her best form. DR. MITCH (3) doesn't win out of turn but recent form sound. Continues to race well, filling the minors at the last three starts, the latest when third (20.86) at Traralgon. Has a good record at this journey. Overdue and gets his chance. DR. EMILIA (2) turned in a moderate performance last time when seventh at Traralgon over 425m behind Comanche Chief (25.42) in a Rank Limit - Restricted Win. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. RAA RAA KIARA (7) is worth another chance despite missing the top-three here most recently. Something for the Multiples: DR. MITCH (3) SON OF RED (5)",
